window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>They took everything from her. Her family.</p> <p>Her home.</p> <p>Her future.</p> <p>Her humanity.</p> <p>It’s only right she returns the favor. No one will stop Ainsley and her dragon horde from laying waste to her enemies, and anyone who dares get in the way. No one except him. Only love can save her from the dark, swirling depths of her grief and pain, and it would have, if Dominic had been fast enough. If only they’d both seen the edge before they fell, dragging the five kingdoms down into a war that would bring about the end of everything……and rise of an enemy far worse than they could ever imagine.</p> <p>Shattered Bonds is the second book in the Broken Legacy trilogy.</p>"; 
